==Strategy==
The main strategy to beat this stage is stacking [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|units with anti-Metal abilities]], such as cats from [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] stages, and Critical Hitters. If you have [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser Cat]], use him, as he has [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Freeze Immunity]]. The main threats in the stage end up being the bulk of the metals, as anti-metals have short range and can easily make it inside Henry's blindspot, making him a minor nuisance at best.

